  "description": "Blazor Webassembly Localization that supports fetching localized texts asynchronously, for example from your backend API.\nInject 'IBlazorLocalizer Loc' and use 'Loc[\"LocalizedStringKeyHere\"]'  or use the component <Localized> to localize your texts.\n\nPlease refer to readme or project URL for a complete setup and usage guide.",
